{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HEADER CALL-TO-ACTION (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Renders the optional header button ("Tailor your rug"). Used twice: to the right of the desktop menu and at the foot
of the mobile menu.

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* text: the button text
* link: the button url
* context: "header" or "sidebar"
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if text != blank and link != blank -%}
  <a href="{{ link }}" class="header-cta header-cta--{{ context }} button button--outline {% if context == 'header' %}button--sm{% else %}w-full{% endif %}">
    {{- text | escape -}}
  </a>
{%- endif -%}
